### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 1: Health & Connectivity Probes
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Gateway Health
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/health

### 1.2 Core Platform Health
GET {{coreUrl}}/health

### 1.3 Event Register Health
GET {{eventUrl}}/api/v1/health

### 1.4 Email Service Health
GET {{emailUrl}}/health

### 1.5 File Service Health
GET {{fileUrl}}/health


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 2: Authentication & Context Switching (Gateway IAM)
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Get Pre-configured Personas
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/personas

### 2.2 Login as Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.3 Login as AI Committee Lead
# @name loginLeadAi
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lead.ai@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.4 Login as AI Committee Member
# @name loginMemberAi
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member.ai@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.5 Login as Applicant
# @name loginApplicant
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "applicant@ieee.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.6 Check Current Identity Profile (Use Admin Token)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 2.7 Switch Active Context/Role (e.g. Lead switching to Global Admin or PR Volunteer)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/switch-context
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "member",
  "scopeType": "committee",
  "scopeId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111"
}


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 3: Public Catalog Discovery (Unauthenticated / Visitor)
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 List All 7 Public Committees (RAS, AI, Web, Cyber, HR, PR, Media)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/public/committees

### 3.2 List Public Published Announcements
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/public/announcements

### 3.3 List Published Media Albums
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/public/media/albums

### 3.4 List Public Branch Events
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 4: Committee Workspace & Task Lifecycle
### ==============================================================================

@aiCommitteeId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### 4.1 Lead Views AI Committee Workspace
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/workspace
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}

### 4.2 Lead Assigns New Task to Member
# @name createTask
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare Computer Vision Workshop Slides",
  "description": "Create 20 slides covering OpenCV basics and PyTorch CNNs",
  "assigneeUserId": "member-ai-1",
  "dueAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### 4.3 Member Checks Personal Dashboard
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/me/dashboard
# Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{{{memberAiToken}}}}

### 4.4 Member Updates Task Status: todo -> in_progress
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.task.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 4.5 Member Updates Task Status: in_progress -> done
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.task.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### 4.6 Lead Uploads Learning Resource Document
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Computer Vision 2026 Roadmap & Syllabus",
  "description": "Full syllabus for the 8-week bootcamp",
  "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/ieee_portal/resources/cv-syllabus.pdf",
  "resourceType": "document"
}

GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}

### 4.7 Lead Posts Internal Committee Announcement (With Image)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Weekly Committee Sync Meeting",
  "body": "Join us this Friday at 6:00 PM on Google Meet for project updates.",
  "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/ieee_portal/announcements/sync-banner.jpg"
}

### 4.8 Committee Members View Internal Announcements
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/committees/{{aiCommitteeId}}/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}

### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 5: HR Recruitment Campaign & Onboarding Pipeline
### ==============================================================================

@hrCommitteeId = 32323232-3232-4323-8323-323232323232

### 5.1 Admin Creates Recruitment Campaign
# @name createCampaign
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "committeeId": "{{hrCommitteeId}}",
  "title": "Fall 2026 IEEE Volunteer Recruitment",
  "description": "Recruiting volunteers across RAS, AI, Web, Cyber, HR, PR, and Media",
  "opensAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "closesAt": "2026-09-15T23:59:59.000Z",
  "status": "open",
  "formSchema": {
    "fullName": { "type": "string", "label": "Full Name", "required": true },
    "universityYear": { "type": "string", "label": "University Year", "required": true },
    "whyJoin": { "type": "string", "label": "Why do you want to join IEEE?", "required": true },
    "resumeUrl": { "type": "string", "label": "Resume URL (PDF)", "required": true }
  }
}

### 5.2 Applicant Submits Recruitment Application
# @name submitApp
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{loginApplicant.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": "{{createCampaign.response.body.campaign.id}}",
  "committeeId": "{{hrCommitteeId}}",
  "answers": {
    "fullName": "Karim Ahmed",
    "universityYear": "3rd Year Computer Science",
    "whyJoin": "Passionate about organizing technical hackathons",
    "resumeUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/ieee_portal/applications/karim-resume.pdf"
  }
}

### 5.3 HR Lead Advances Application: applied -> screening
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications/{{submitApp.response.body.application.id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "screening",
  "notes": "Resume meets technical requirements."
}

### 5.4 HR Lead Advances Application: screening -> interview
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications/{{submitApp.response.body.application.id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "interview",
  "notes": "Scheduled for behavioral interview on Saturday.",
  "score": 85
}

### 5.5 HR Lead Advances Application: interview -> final_review
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications/{{submitApp.response.body.application.id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "final_review",
  "notes": "Strong communication and leadership skills."
}

### 5.6 HR Lead Accepts Application (Assigns Member Role & Generates Checklist)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/applications/{{submitApp.response.body.application.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Welcome to IEEE Menoufia!"
}

### 5.7 Check Onboarding Checklist Items for Candidate
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/onboarding/applicant-1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 5.8 View HR Recruitment Funnel Summary Report
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/hr/reports/pipeline-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 6: PR Broadcast & Media Operations Flow
### ==============================================================================

### 6.1 PR Lead Posts Public Branch Announcement
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/pr/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "IEEE Menoufia Mega Tech Festival Announced!",
  "body": "3 days of robotics competitions, AI workshops, and cybersecurity challenges.",
  "visibility": "public",
  "committeeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}"
}

### 6.2 Media Lead Requests Cloudinary Presigned Direct Upload Signature
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/files/signature
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "folder": "media_albums",
  "resourceType": "image"
}

### 6.3 Media Lead Creates Album
# @name createAlbum
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "committeeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}",
  "title": "AI Bootcamp 2026 Photo Gallery",
  "description": "Memories and hands-on session highlights"
}

### 6.4 Media Lead Attaches Photo Asset to Album
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.album.id}}/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/ieee_portal/media_albums/ai-bootcamp-01.jpg",
  "assetType": "image",
  "caption": "Participants training deep neural networks"
}

### 6.5 Media Lead Publishes Album
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/albums/{{createAlbum.response.body.album.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 6.6 Committee Lead Requests Media Coverage for Workshop
# @name createCoverage
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/coverage-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLeadAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "committeeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}",
  "mediaCommitteeId": "{{aiCommitteeId}}",
  "title": "Live Video & Photography for AI Project Showcase",
  "eventAt": "2026-09-20T10:00:00.000Z",
  "description": "Need photographer and videographer for 3 hours."
}

### 6.7 Media Lead Accepts Coverage Request
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/media/coverage-requests/{{createCoverage.response.body.request.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "accepted"
}


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 7: Member Avatar Management
### ==============================================================================

### 7.1 Request Avatar Presigned Signature (with face crop transform)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/files/signature
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "folder": "avatars",
  "resourceType": "image"
}

### 7.2 Update Member Profile Avatar URL in Core Platform
PATCH {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "avatarUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,w_400,h_400,g_face/ieee_portal/avatars/member-ai-profile.jpg"
}

### 7.3 Verify Updated Avatar in Dashboard
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/core/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberAi.response.body.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### FLOW 8: Event Management, QR Ticketing & Scanner Check-in
### ==============================================================================

### 8.1 Create Branch Event with Banner
# @name createEvent
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Menoufia AI Summit 2026",
  "description": "Premier Artificial Intelligence & Robotics Conference",
  "date": "2026-10-15T09:00:00.000Z",
  "location": "Faculty of Electronic Engineering Main Auditorium",
  "bannerUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/ieee_portal/events/summit-banner.jpg"
}

### 8.2 Register Participant for Event
# @name registerParticipant
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmed Hassan",
  "email": "ahmed.hassan@example.com",
  "phone": "+201001234567"
}

### 8.3 Scanner Check-in via QR Ticket Scan
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/qr/scan
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketId": "{{registerParticipant.response.body.participant._id}}"
}

### 8.4 View Event Attendance Report
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/attendance/report
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 8.5 Export Attendance CSV
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.event._id}}/attendance/export
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}


